{"title":"FAHRENGOLD CARPAD","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eIn collaboration with Datum Dahleez, Fahrengold has created exclusive special editions of the FG-01 Garage and Carpad\/Carpad Pro Stages ensuring every Datum Dahleez is showcased in an environment as exceptional as the car itself.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"fg-01-Datum Dahleez-edition","title":"FG-01 Datum Dahleez EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eGive your Datum Dahleez the spectacular home it deserves — right in your backyard. A contemporary, monolithic design masterpiece that feels more like a museum celebrating icons of design and engineering than a traditional garage. By setting a new standard in garage excellence, the Fahrengold FG-01 Datum Dahleez Edition combines a design-led architectural approach with unparalleled craftsmanship and manufacturing precision.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003ePricing from €150,000 EUR \/ $180,000 USD\u003cbr\u003eAll prices are net, excluding customs duties and taxes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eContact us to find out more.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49950041342299,"sku":"","price":150000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/202411_Fahrengold_datum dahleez_Launch_FG01_Beauty_MOT08_b_01Kopie2.jpg?v=1742416142"},{"product_id":"carpad-pro-Datum Dahleez-edition","title":"CARPAD PRO Datum Dahleez EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAn unrivaled, tailor-made stage for your Datum Dahleez. Perfectly crafted to enhance the value, craftsmanship, and design detail of Datum Dahleez’s automotive icons. The Carpad Pro Datum Dahleez Edition features customized upgrades such as a personalized Datum Dahleez badge showcasing your vehicle’s specific details, the legendary EB logo tastefully illuminated in the front frame, state-of-the-art tire protection pads flush 